{:adr-id "2607141920"
 :title "cloud-itonami-isic-0710 — Iron Ore Mining Operations Coordinator"
 :date "2026-07-14"
 :author "Cloud Itonami Contributors"
 :status :accepted
 :context
 "ISIC Rev.5 0710 (Mining of iron ores) adds the 90th actor to the
  cloud-itonami fleet. Scope: operations coordination only
  (production logging, maintenance scheduling, safety flagging,
  shipment coordination). Permanently excludes extraction authority,
  blasting operations, and mine-safety-authority decisions."
 :decision
 {:scope-boundary
  "Coordination-only actor. Proposes four ops: log-production,
   schedule-maintenance, flag-safety-concern (always escalates),
   coordinate-shipment. Forbids: extraction/extract, extraction/blast,
   authority/safety-clearance."
  :governor-rules
  "Five HARD checks: (1) forbidden operations block, (2) spec-basis
   citation required, (3) verified site record required, (4) safety
   concerns always escalate, (5) low confidence escalates."
  :comparison
  "Like quarrying/0810 (extract then ship) but coordination-only.
   Like retail/4711, freight/4920: proposes and coordinates, never
   executes capital extraction. Establishes precedent for mining-ops
   scope boundary."
 }
 :consequences
 ["90th actor in fleet (89 implemented before)"
  "Establishes permanent mining-ops scope boundary"
  "Registry: pinned to cloud-itonami-isic-0710, maturity :implemented"
  "Test suite: 16 tests / 35 assertions"
  "Demo: three coordination + three forbidden-op scenarios"
 ]
